        trash_main_rule: "Please put your garbage in a garbage can or bag and we will collect it together after check-out. There are trash cans in your room for burnable, non-burnable, and recyclable trash, and we ask for your cooperation in separating these items.",
        fukuoka_trash_h: "[Fukuoka City Designated Burnable Trash]", fukuoka_trash_body: "Food waste / Plastics / Papers / Diaper / Cigarette butt / Wooden waste",
